## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design a scalable, secure, and observable multi-tenant ingestion path on GCP with evolving schemas and strict governance.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation in Storage and BigQuery
- Event-driven path: Storage -> Pub/Sub -> Dataflow
- Schema evolution and late-arrival handling
- Privacy controls, IAM least privilege, and VPC Service Controls
- Cost controls with per-tenant quotas and autoscaling

